{
  "_meta": {
    "purpose": "English high-frequency observation markers. At memory_compile time, any message containing a marker yields an Observation with the mapped action, which becomes a fact. Ship with the binary; users can customize by editing this file.",
    "actions": {
      "love": "preference (strong positive)",
      "like": "preference (positive)",
      "plan": "goal / plan",
      "want": "wish / desire",
      "feel": "emotion / body state"
    },
    "note": "Markers match case-sensitively with `find`; lowercase covers the common case ('I love it', 'she plans to'). Multi-word markers (burned out, heartbroken) avoid single-word false positives."
  },
